Package: same-gnome
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: djackson <djackson@sonic.danieljackson.systems>
Installed-Size: 301
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libcairo2 (>= 1.2.4), libglib2.0-0t64 (>= 2.32.0), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.0.0)
Section: games
Priority: optional
Description: Modern GTK4 port of the classic GNOME Same puzzle game
 A modern GTK4 port of the classic GNOME "Same" puzzle game, featuring
 3D ball rotation, dynamic screen scaling, and configurable board sizes
 up to 256x256.
 .
 Click on groups of 2 or more adjacent same-colored balls to remove them.
 The goal is to clear the entire board. Larger groups yield higher scores.
